    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale this Semi-Detached Bungalow with Attic Conversion\nConveniently located just off Main Street in Kilmacrennan, this well-presented semi-detached bungalow is within easy walking distance of the village's amenities.\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a living room, kitchen/dining area, sun room, two bedrooms, bathroom and separate shower room on ground floor. The attic has also been converted to provide two additional rooms, offering useful extra space for a variety of purposes.\nExternally, the property occupies a spacious site, with a landscaped garden to the front and a concrete yard to the rear. Additional benefits include a detached garage and separate coal stores.\nWith its convenient village location, generous outdoor space and versatile accommodation, this property would make an ideal first-time buyer home or family residence.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.6 x 2.5\nL shaped hallway. Carpet covering on floor. Stairs leading to attic conversion\n\nLiving Room - 4.2 x 3.8\nCarpet covering on floor. Coving and centre ceiling rose. Built in display unit at either side of fireplace incorporating TV unit. Fireplace with mahogany surround. Glass panel door leading to kitchen/dining area.\n\nKitchen/Dining area - 5.6 x 3.5\nLinoleum covering on floor. Eye and low level units with tiled splash back. Built in electric oven with four ring hob and overhead extractor fan. Plumbed for dishwasher and washing machine. Solid fuel burning stove with back boiler to compliment the oil fired heating. Hot press. Coving. Glass panel doors leading to Sun room/Side Porch.\n\nSun Room/Side Porch - 4.8 x 2.5\nTiled flooring. High vaulted suspended timber ceiling with recessed lighting. Door to side of property.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.4 x 3.0\nLaminated timber flooring. Built in wardrobe incorporating wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0 x 2.7\nLaminated timber flooring. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.1 x 1.5\nTiled flooring. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and bath.\n\nShower Room - 2.0 x 1.5\nTiled flooring and partially tiled walls. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nAttic Conversion - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.9 x 2.2\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in wardrobe. Velux window promoting natural light.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.3 x 2.2\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in wardrobe. Velux window promoting natural light.\n\nGarage - 8.0 x 2.5\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Semi detached bungalow</li><li>Constructed 1950</li><li>Total floor area 109 sq m</li><li>Comprising 2 ground floor bedrooms</li><li>Attic conversion comprising 2 further bedrooms</li><li>Sun room extension added to the property</li><li>Presented well internally</li><li>Dual fired heating</li><li>Occupying spacious site with garden to front</li><li>Tarmac driveway and concrete yard to rear </li><li>Masonry built detached garage.</li><li>Coal store</li><li>Located off Main Street, Kilmacrennan</li><li>Convenient to all village amenities</ul>"
      },
